<title>SWEDEN: Svedala buys U.S. Reedrill drilling firm.</title>
<headline>Svedala buys U.S. Reedrill drilling firm.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish steel group Svedala said on Monday it had acquired U.S. drilling equipment group Reedrill Corp. Inc.</p>
<p>The Texas-based group has an annual turnover of around 600 million crowns and about 400 employees, Svedala said in a statement, without disclosing the purchase sum.</p>
<p>&quot;The acquisition gives an increased range of products which will increase Svedala's unique position on the market as the complete supplier to the construction and mining industry,&quot; Svedala said.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1003</p>
